      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/basile_louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1922, Basile hosted the Evangeline Industrial Home, a Methodist‑run school for girls.",
